{
  "id": "700",
  "title": "Do you know about “Taobao”?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-10-26",
  "synopsis": "Where do you shop? Have you heard of this big online shopping website?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/700/4daa83dd093cf4913addf95ed279dd4b9c70ebcd.mp3?1571053686",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你知道“淘宝”吗？\n\n丽丽：你的衣服真好看！\n本：是吗？谢谢！我新买的，158元。\n丽丽：那么贵？你在哪儿买的？\n本：学校旁边的商店。\n丽丽：你知道“淘宝”吗？中国人都喜欢在“淘宝”买衣服。\n本：为什么？\n丽丽：因为“淘宝”的衣服比商店便宜。",
    "traditional": "你知道“淘寶”嗎？\n\n麗麗：你的衣服真好看！\n本：是嗎？謝謝！我新買的，158元。\n麗麗：那麼貴？你在哪兒買的？\n本：學校旁邊的商店。\n麗麗：你知道“淘寶”嗎？中國人都喜歡在“淘寶”買衣服。\n本：為什麼？\n麗麗：因為“淘寶”的衣服比商店便宜。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you know about “Taobao”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你的衣服真好看！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你的衣服真好看！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ de yī fu zhēn hǎo kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Your shirt is really good-looking!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：是吗？谢谢！我新买的，158元。",
      "traditional": "本：是嗎？謝謝！我新買的，158元。",
      "pinyin": "běn shì ma xiè xie wǒ xīn mǎi de 5 yuán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Is it? Thank you! I just bought it, for 158 yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那么贵？你在哪儿买的？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那麼貴？你在哪兒買的？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà me guì nǐ zài nǎ'r mǎi de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: That expensive? Where did you buy it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：学校旁边的商店。",
      "traditional": "本：學校旁邊的商店。",
      "pinyin": "běn xué xiào páng biān de shāng diàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: At the shop next to the school."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你知道“淘宝”吗？中国人都喜欢在“淘宝”买衣服。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你知道“淘寶”嗎？中國人都喜歡在“淘寶”買衣服。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ zhī dào táo bǎo ma zhōng guó rén dōu xǐ huan zài táo bǎo mǎi yī fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Do you know about “Taobao”? All Chinese people like to buy clothes at “Taobao”."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：为什么？",
      "traditional": "本：為什麼？",
      "pinyin": "běn wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：因为“淘宝”的衣服比商店便宜。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：因為“淘寶”的衣服比商店便宜。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yīn wèi táo bǎo de yī fu bǐ shāng diàn pián yi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Because clothes from “Taobao” are cheaper than in stores."
    }
  ],
